{"ref":"BDB, עַי","hw":"עַי","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">עַי</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עַיָּ֑ת</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עַיָּה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> Αγγαι (Gn), Γαι:<br><strong>1.</strong>  old Canaanit. city, <span dir=\"rtl\">עַי</span> always c. art. <span dir=\"rtl\">הָעַי</span> (<span dir=\"rtl\">הָעָ֑י</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 13:3\" href=\"/Genesis.13.3\">Gn 13:3</a> +), near Bethel to the SE. (exact site unknown, cf. Di <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:2\" href=\"/Joshua.7.2\">Jos. 7:2</a> Buhl<sup>Geogr. 177</sup>), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 12:8\" href=\"/Genesis.12.8\">Gn 12:8</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 13:3\" href=\"/Genesis.13.3\">13:3</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:2\" href=\"/Joshua.7.2\">Jos 7:2</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:3\" href=\"/Joshua.7.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:4\" href=\"/Joshua.7.4\">4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:5\" href=\"/Joshua.7.5\">5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:1\" href=\"/Joshua.8.1\">8:1</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:2\" href=\"/Joshua.8.2\">2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:3\" href=\"/Joshua.8.3\">3</a> + 18 times <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8\" href=\"/Joshua.8\">Jos 8</a> (+ Qr v <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:12\" href=\"/Joshua.8.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:16\" href=\"/Joshua.8.16\">16</a>, but improb., Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">עיר</span>, cf. Di), <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:3\" href=\"/Joshua.9.3\">9:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:1\" href=\"/Joshua.10.1\">10:1</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:2\" href=\"/Joshua.10.2\">2</a> (all JE), <a data-ref=\"Joshua 12:9\" href=\"/Joshua.12.9\">12:9</a> (D), <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:28\" href=\"/Ezra.2.28\">Ezr 2:28</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:31\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.31\">Ne 7:32</a>; = <span dir=\"rtl\">עַיָּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:28\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.28\">Is 10:28</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עַיָּה</span> (so Baer Ginsb, > <span dir=\"rtl\">עַיָּא</span> van d. H.) <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:31\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.31\">Ne 11:31</a>, so read also (for <span dir=\"rtl\">עַזָּה</span> q.v. ad fin.) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:28\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.28\">1 Ch 7:28</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  E. Jordan city <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.3\">Je 49:3</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶשְׁבוֹן</span>), but read <span dir=\"rtl\">עָר</span> <em>city</em> (?) Gf Rothst<sup>Kau</sup> Co (<span dir=\"rtl\">הָעִיר</span>?).","next":"BDB, עִי²","prev":"BDB, עֲטִישָׁה"}